{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23620","headline":"武丘寺路宴留别诸妓 · 白居易","name":"武丘寺路宴留别诸妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银泥帬映锦障泥，画舸停桡马簇蹄。\n清管曲终鹦鹉语，红旗影动䮂䮧嘶。\n渐消醉色朱颜浅，欲语离情翠黛低。\n莫忘使君吟咏处，女坟湖北武丘西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}